  // tail-jumps to __fern_report, so a per-access check stays a compare + a
  // jae to a shared label. __fern_oob_abort is arr_get / arr_set,
  // __fern_str_oob_abort a string byte and the inline str_slice view,
  // __fern_slice_abort the __fern_arr_slice bodies' range check,
  // __fern_alloc_size_abort a raw_alloc or __alloc_u8 size that is negative
  // as an i32, which is how a helper's `la + lb` looks once it wraps past
  // 2 GiB. Texts and statuses match the native backends'.
