  // len/index/slice/concat/eq — is unchanged) and rc@box-8 uses the SAME rc word
  // as arrays (__fern_rc_inc / __fn___fern_rc_is_unique read -8(ptr)). Freed by the
  // rc-aware __fern_str_free at rc==1.
